			"notes": "# MoreSparkles 1.3.0 (Cobblemon 1.8.0 / Minecraft 1.21.1)\n\nMoreSparkles is no longer just a shiny booster. This release rebuilds the mod from the ground up and adds **nine new boost types**, a matching set of **charms**, **Discord webhook** announcements for boosts, and **Placeholder API** support.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **This update breaks existing configs and saved data.** Back up `config/MoreSparkles/` before you update, and read the [migration notes](#%EF%B8%8F-breaking-changes--migration) below.\n\n## ✨ New boost types\n\nBoosts now have a type. Every command, boost area, charm and placeholder works with each of these types:\n\n| Type | What it boosts |\n|---|---|\n| `SHINY` | Shiny odds (the existing boost) |\n| `EXPERIENCE` | Experience gained in battle |\n| `HIDDEN_ABILITY` | Chance that wild spawns have their Hidden Ability |\n| `EV` | EVs gained |\n| `IV` | IV quality of Pokémon you catch, hatch or revive from fossils |\n| `BERRY` | Berry harvest yield |\n| `CATCH_RATE` | Catch rate |\n| `MARK` | Chance of a mark on Pokémon you catch, hatch or revive from fossils |\n| `ALPHA` | Alpha spawn chance |\n| `SPAWN_BUCKET` | Odds of uncommon, rare and ultra-rare spawn buckets |\n\nEach player can run one active boost per type at a time, with a separate queue for each type.\n\n## 🍀 New charms\n\nNine new charms, each with its own texture, join the Shiny Charm:\n\n- **Exp Charm** (Experience)\n- **Veiled Charm** (Hidden Ability)\n- **Effort Charm** (EV)\n- **IV Charm** (IV)\n- **Berry Charm** (Berry)\n- **Catching Charm** (Catch Rate)\n- **Mark Charm** (Mark)\n- **Alpha Charm** (Alpha)\n- **Bucket Charm** (Spawn Bucket)\n\nIn `items.json` you can set each charm's boost type, multiplier and lore. The charms also have their own creative tab.\n\n## 📣 Discord webhooks\n\nMoreSparkles can post boosts to a Discord channel. The embed updates while the boost runs, and by default it is deleted when the boost ends. Set it up under `webhook_settings` in `config.json`:\n\n```json\n\"webhook_settings\": {\n  \"enabled\": false,\n  \"url\": \"https://discord.com/api/webhooks/your_webhook_url\",\n  \"update_rate_seconds\": 30,\n  \"delete_when_boost_ends\": true\n}\n```\n\n## 🧩 Placeholder API support\n\nWhen [Placeholder API](https://modrinth.com/mod/placeholder-api) is installed, the following placeholders are registered under the `moresparkles:` namespace. Placeholder API is optional.\n\n**Server:** `base_shiny_rate`, `base_bucket_chance`, `base_alpha_bucket_chance`\n\n**Player:** `player_shiny_rate`, `player_hidden_ability_chance`, `player_iv_strength`, `player_bucket_chance`, `player_alpha_bucket_chance`, and `player_<type>_multiplier` for each boost type, using the lowercased type name (for example `player_shiny_multiplier`, `player_experience_multiplier` or `player_spawn_bucket_multiplier`)\n\n`messages.json` also has many new built-in placeholders for boosts (`boost_multiplier`, `boost_duration`, `boost_time_remaining`, `boost_type`) and boost areas (`boost_area_name`, `boost_area_type`, `boost_area_multiplier`).\n\n## ⚙️ New config options\n\n- `pause_player_boosts_on_shutdown` / `pause_global_boosts_on_shutdown`: keep the remaining boost time when the server restarts.\n- `experience_booster_ignores_candy` / `experience_booster_ignores_sidemod_source`: stop the Experience boost from multiplying candy or experience from other mods.\n- `ev_booster_ignores_vitamins` / `ev_booster_ignores_sidemod_source`: the same for the EV boost.\n- `hidden_ability_booster_base_chance`: the base Hidden Ability chance that the multiplier scales (default `0.05`).\n- `iv_booster_strength_constant`: how strongly the IV boost shifts IVs upward.\n- `persistent_data_key_blacklist`: skip boosts on Pokémon that carry certain persistent data keys (by default, the IV boost skips raid Pokémon).\n\nBoost areas now take a `boost_type` and a `display_name`.\n\n## 🛠️ Changes & fixes\n\n- The mod was fully refactored: commands, config loading, player data and boost handling were rewritten.\n\n..."
		}
